## PROLOGUE — "The Night It All Began" (ليلة البداية)
## In-media-res escape: battered Tito runs the Syndicate cordon through a
## storm-drowned Cairo-inspired metropolis, ending on a rooftop duel with
## his corrupt mentor EL-GHORAB (The Raven). Chains into Chapter 1
## (levels/cairo_night.tscn) after the flatline outro.
##
## Segment map (x left->right):
##   S1  -10..16  alley: movement basics + crawl-under shutter + siren dread
##   S2   16..34  dojo: two light thugs (punch tutorial)
##   S3   34..52  traffic: shield enforcer — frontal immune, hit his back
##   S4   52..84  denial: smoke-launcher + red-line tactical agent -> canopy route
##   S5   84..104 barricade: wipe the squad -> the gate breaches
##   SC  105..112 scaffold zigzag up to the rooftop
##   RF  112..146 stormy roof: girders y=12, floodlights, EL-GHORAB duel
##
## Renderer honesty: this is GL Compatibility — no volumetrics/SSR/SDFGI.
## Rain = CPUParticles3D streaks; smog = exp fog + tinted parallax; lamp
## cones = unshaded translucent meshes; PBR = albedo+normal+roughness stacks
## generated by tools/gen_prologue_art.py. All architecture is real 3D mesh.
extends Node3D

